     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCOPE-01\"> </a></b>Define DAK purpose and target audience</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can articulate the purpose of the DAK, identify the target audience, assess whether similar publications exist, and define the gaps the DAK will address.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCOPE-02\"> </a></b>Establish development process</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can establish the development process and governance to be used, including selection of agile methodology and determination of ownership and key stakeholders.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCOPE-03\"> </a></b>Determine project tooling</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can determine the tools to be used for project tracking, communication, and DAK components design (e.g. BPMN tooling).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCOPE-04\"> </a></b>Assess resource requirements</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can assess the necessary resources to develop the DAK, including securing adequate budget for each step of the process.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"SCOPE-05\"> </a></b>Gather source documents</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can gather and catalogue source documents including normative products, policy documents, paper registers, tally sheets, and reporting tools.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ScopeDAK\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCOPE-01\"> </a></b>Define DAK purpose and target audience</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can articulate the purpose of the DAK, identify the target audience, assess whether similar publications exist, and define the gaps the DAK will address.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-SCOPE-02\"> </a></b>Establish development process</td><td><a href=\"ht